+Show the Config
+---------------
+
+To inspect the loaded configuration, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>`
+command. It prints the configuration as JSON, with values for any key containing
+``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` masked as ``"***"``. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+
